# Pop-punk / power-pop: 8 verses, 6 pre-choruses, 7 choruses and 4 bridges, written for the song style "rock",
# substyle "pop-punk". Fast eighth-note verses on repeated notes, stop-start bars and pickups, shout-along choruses
# with held peaks, I-V-vi-IV and vi-IV-I-V at speed, half-time bridges that build back.

